Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should have kept\Nlooking in the city after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, in the city there's a high likelihood\Nthey'd be picked up by kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and above all, they're easy to find there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, a nice wide-open space.\NIt should be easy to search here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Uh, I'm just a--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--Liar.\N--Uh, I'm just a--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:01:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a gatherer too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is my turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Die now... Or help me find the coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass on both!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the right move here? I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no information to go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Three hours earlier"\N"Keep Out"\N"Suspicious persons will be\Nreported to the police immediately"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do you smell any humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I don't think there's anyone around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No surprise, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.33,0:03:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't any trails\Nthis deep in the mountains--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we'll find any people\Nout picking wildflowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, if we run into anyone out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's safe to assume they're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll you do if we actually run into one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it depends on what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ideally, we'd see them\Nbefore they see us and attack--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do that!\NWe won't know if they're good or evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Although we won't last long\Nif we fight every person we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, what we really need now is information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The alien told us we could\Nfind lots of coins here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but in a big area like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not going to find anything\Njust looking around randomly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to know exactly\Nwhere the other coins were found
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.37,0:04:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and how many other monsters\Nor "gatherers" there are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are the strongest ones?\NWhere are they and what are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:05:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If we find someone,\Nyou should transform right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll probably find them before they find us...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you have that powerful nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure I should transform?\NWhat if they're just a normal person?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbass. Remember?\NOnly monsters will come up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the opposite of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here, we need to hide our real faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we encounter someone bad\Nand they see who we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,our normal lives will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They could threaten\Nto tell our school or our family,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,or worse yet, our friends and family\Ncould get caught up in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, facing them in\Nyour monster form will put them on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it fascinating, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Two monsters that don't know\Neach other's background, personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,or abilities, clashing with each other\Nin the middle of the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems like they're not that close...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe 200 meters off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I have time to take off my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:07:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We could avoid danger\Nand steadily gather up coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That might seem like the\Nright approach at first glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.91,0:07:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're taking your time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,someone else could gather\Nall the coins and gain their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're afraid of taking a risk,\Nyou'll be too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.66,0:07:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The right approach is to meet the risk head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Way bigger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with those hands?\NIf it attacks me with those...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time\Nan enemy has approached me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've felt the presence of\Ngatherers many times before,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but as soon as they see me, they run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your enemy. I just want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your voice... You're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I shouldn't expect too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alone, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How clever! She's making him\Nthink there's only one person here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to talk about the coins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't know much about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here. I was hoping we could help each--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not come her to look for coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted strength,\Nand this is what I got from the alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I used it on normal people,\Nthey were nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get a feel for\Nmy new strength at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know how strong I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The alien told me I could meet\Nother "gatherers" here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not excited about fighting a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't move forward without sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we must fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have made a mistake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A normal human would have\Nbeen killed instantly by that strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I withstood it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That answers one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No... We'll be crushed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.95,0:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a solid strike! I could feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble.\NThis guy might be out of our league.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the first monster we fought as\Na standard to predict others' strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But if everyone out here is like this guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Like her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't die now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough? I think we know now--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're much stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't come here to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The coins, huh? What do\Nyou want them for, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that kind of power ends up\Nin the hands of someone dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no telling what they'll use it for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to share\Nas much information as possible--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, how can you prove\Nthat you are not someone dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone searching for the coins,\Neveryone that seeks power thinks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They think everyone else is an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how this place works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we could be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You good, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there would be fights\Nwe couldn't avoid here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And when they come, I won't hesitate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That answers another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My body can withstand bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it did pierce one of my arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't a normal gun, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to predict, to some degree,\Nwhere you'd aim, which allowed me to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I was slightly off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was confident that you would aim to kill.\NAllow me to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Tadanori Sanbe.\NI'm a sophomore at Yamakita University.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're revealing your identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my way of saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought with your life, to take mine.\NYou deserve thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I always desired strength\Nand learned various martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But those methods were\Ncreated by humans, for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't quite fit this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that stance?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I came up with my own martial art form.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've yet to perfect it--it's not the prettiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it still needs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Power alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To use it in a real fight,\NI must be accurate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Another question answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I did feel decent impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She shouldn't be able to get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fight is not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This might get a bit messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? You want to see who's stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you screwing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know by now--\Nmy raw strength is beyond yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you now afraid of\Nputting your life on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Was a friend of yours hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is the same voice I heard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So who is this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The tables have completely turned on me,\Nand I don't even know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what it means\Nto put your life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt I can shake you off in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she controlling this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose. Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to kill anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there are two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This one must be a gatherer that transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.45,0:16:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If that girl is a normal human...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That gun was powerful enough to pierce my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If she fires it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.62,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think he'd transform back like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.\NIt's his fault for doing something so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We put our lives on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We gain nothing by killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet we had to "put our lives\Non the line" for your stupid fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to make this up to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.37,0:18:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not manly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady... Don't you think it's time\Nyou put some clothes on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't! I left them somewhere back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have a phone,\Ngive me your address and phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.16,0:18:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me have it, too! And you two, give me yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He was downwind from us,\Nso I didn't catch his scent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to run, now.\NI got some lovely pictures of your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:19:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you run back to town, I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and my friends are gonna\Nmake you feel real special, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go making a ruckus\Nlike that in these mountains...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or some dangerous type like me\Nis going to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you're my slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're clearly low-life scum...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...so I'll have no second\Nthoughts about killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so powerful--I thought\Nall the monsters were like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like that's not the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So... What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to help us look for coins, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll have plenty\Nof chances to test your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can wait till you heal, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke some ribs, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.79,0:20:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.29,0:20:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me this, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:21:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your relationship with that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.79,0:21:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I turn into the costume thing,\Nand she gets inside and fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I didn't do anything this time, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Was splitting up her idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--That idiot said he'd be bait,\Nand I could run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Idiot?!\N--That idiot said he'd be bait,\Nand I could run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I set it up that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hated that plan though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to die, I want to die with Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, you're a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:21:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! We should probably go back\Nbefore this guy's friends come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just found our next prey, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 6: Gatherers"
